The registry-first sample tests/registry/li.jsonl contains addresses, postcodes, postal
localities and coordinates from the "Offizielles Verzeichnis der Gebäudeadressen" (official
directory of building addresses) of Liechtenstein, downloaded on 2026-10-31 from
https://service.geo.llv.li/download/getfile.php?theme=officialAdress (dataset.csv of
2026-08-18). Source: Liechtensteinische Landesverwaltung.

Used under the "Nutzungsbedingungen für die offiziellen Verzeichnisse der Strassen, der
Gebäudeadressen und der Ortschaften der Liechtensteinischen Landesverwaltung" (ABI/OGD-Version 2
vom 5.2.2021), enclosed in the download as AbiOGDLizenz.pdf: the data may be copied, passed on
free of charge, enriched, processed, combined and used commercially, provided the source
"Liechtensteinische Landesverwaltung" is stated and these terms are enclosed or linked. All
rights in the data remain with their statutory holders; the Landesverwaltung accepts no liability
for its correctness. The terms are published with the download and listed on
https://opendata.swiss/de/dataset/offizielles-verzeichnis-der-gebaudeadressen-liechtenstein.

Changes: a sample was drawn and the query forms constructed from the directory's fields; each
municipality number was given its municipality's name and ISO 3166-2 code. Neither the
Landesverwaltung nor anyone else has approved this sample. Per-case file checksums and the
retrieval date are recorded in the corpus; docs/evaluation/registry/li.md records the upstream
checksums.
